<%- include("partials/header",{title:"Support Center"}) %>
<main class="lightPage"><section class="lightTitle"><div class="wrap pageHeroGrid"><div><div class="pageEyebrow">Player Support</div><h1>Support Center</h1><p>Installation help, account recovery, and direct paths to the EverLeaf team.</p></div><div class="pageHeroAside"><strong>Fastest help</strong><span>Use the guides below first. If you still need help, Discord is the fastest route to staff.</span></div></div></section><div class="wrap helpGrid">
<section class="helpCard"><div class="helpIcon">🚀</div><h3>Installation & Updates</h3><p>Download the launcher, extract it into an empty folder, and use <strong>Install / Repair Files</strong> for missing or interrupted files. Always launch through EverLeafLauncher.exe.</p><a class="btn" href="/downloads">DOWNLOADS</a></section>
<section class="helpCard"><div class="helpIcon">🔐</div><h3>Login Problems</h3><p>Your website and game use the same account. If you can sign in here, change your password from the Account page.</p><a class="btn" href="/account">ACCOUNT</a></section>
<section class="helpCard"><div class="helpIcon">🔑</div><h3>Forgot Account Details</h3><p>Submit a private recovery request using your username or account email. Staff verifies ownership before making changes.</p><a class="btn" href="/recover">ACCOUNT RECOVERY</a></section>
<section class="helpCard"><div class="helpIcon">💬</div><h3>Talk to the Community</h3><p>Get help from staff and other players on Discord. Keep your account details private.</p><% if(brand.discordUrl){ %><a class="btn primary" href="<%=brand.discordUrl%>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">JOIN DISCORD</a><% } else { %><a class="btn primary" href="/community">COMMUNITY</a><% } %></section>
</div></main><%- include("partials/footer") %>
